Package: hermian
Architecture: amd64 arm64
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, systemd
Recommends: nftables
Suggests: libpam-modules
Description: lightweight defensive security daemon
 HERMIAN detects high-confidence signs of compromise on a Linux host using
 deterministic, contextual detection (process chains, SSH abuse, persistence,
 privilege escalation, anomalous network behavior) and alerts locally via
 journald, a log file, or a webhook. No dashboard, no YAML rules, no alert
 fatigue: install, enable, forget - HERMIAN only interrupts you when it matters.
